      "transcript_text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an alkali chemical burn to the eye do well once it's treated properly. I'll request an urgent pH check, it'll help with chemical burn. Let's get an urgent eye assessment, for chemical eye injury. I'd like you to take sterile saline irrigation, 2 litres, continuous, until pH neutral. That's for chemical eye burn.",
